# Collaborative Storytelling App

A full-stack web application for creating, sharing, and collaborating on stories with real-time editing, version control, and profile customization.

## 🚀 Features

### Core Features
- **Authentication**: JWT-based authentication with secure password storage using bcrypt
- **CRUD Operations**: Create, read, update, and delete stories
- **Collaboration**: Add/remove contributors to stories
- **Authorization**: Only authors and collaborators can edit; only authors can delete
- **Responsive Design**: Mobile and desktop friendly with dark theme
- **State Management**: Redux Toolkit for global state management
- **Type Safety**: TypeScript throughout the entire project

### Advanced Features (Planned)
- Real-time editing with WebSocket
- Version control for stories
- Profile customization
- Comment system

